{"unit_id":"regrevia__dsh-lite-memory#card-zh","repo":"regrevia/dsh-lite-memory","commit":"568075ad9aa90ca948242fbcbb4bd174a475173e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lite-memory（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 提供按需跨会话记忆，让重要约定、经验和资料指针能在后续任务中找回。它向 DSH 注册记忆工具，并在会话界面加入记忆行与管理面板。用户可以保存或建议记忆、按当前问题检索卡片、按标题读取正文、将条目归档，也能查看项目记忆并管理自进化规则。记忆默认按项目隔离，也可显式写入全局层；本地文件保存于 DSH_HOME 下。适合希望复用项目约定、减少重复说明并在需要时查阅历史经验的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2520-2523","index.js:2825-2828","index.js:2973-2976","index.js:3149-3153","state.js:257-265","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"regrevia__dsh-lite-memory#card-en","repo":"regrevia/dsh-lite-memory","commit":"568075ad9aa90ca948242fbcbb4bd174a475173e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-lite-memory adds on-demand memory to DeepSeek Harness for the Web client. It registers tools to save, suggest, search, read, and archive entries, with a session panel for managing project memories. Entries are scoped by project, optionally global, and stored locally under DSH_HOME.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2520-2523","index.js:2825-2828","index.js:2973-2976","index.js:3149-3153","state.js:257-265","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
